    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oburuchi bwaYosia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Yosia yali owemiyika munaane olwa yachaaka okhuruka; ne yaruchila muYerusalemu emiyika amakhumi kataru namulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yakhola akali amalayi mumoni tsiOMWAMI, nachenda munjila tsiaDaudi kuukanyene, nareebera khumukhono musaatsa kata omukhasi ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Yosia yakololosia mushialo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba mumuyika kwomunaane kwoburuchibwe, olwa yali nashili omuraaka, yachaaka okhukhaaba Nynsaye waDaudi kuukanyene; mana mumuyika kwekhumi nakhabili yachaaka okhusiiya Yuda naYerusalemu, mbu okhuyiniamwo habundu aheechingu hosi, nemiAshera, nebifwanani ebibaztse, nebifwanani ebisalule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibalikulula ebimalilo biabaBaali ye naliho, nebimalilo biamalesi kelibuuliesi, ebiali ikulu wabio, yabiremaka; nemiAshera, nebifwanani ebibaatse, nebifwanani ebisalule, yabisasachila elala nabikwisia olufu, nalumiitsa khubilindwa bia abo abalinji nibabimalila emisango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasambila amakumba kabeesaaliisii khubimalilo biabio, nasiiya Yuda naYerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi nakhola ario mumataala kaManase naEfuraimu naSimeoni, kata okhuula khuNafutali, mumalikulukho kako tsimbeka tsiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalikulula ebimalilo biako, natubulila elala emiAshera nebifwanani ebibaatse nibikwisia bibe shinga obusie; naremaka ebimalilo biamalesi kelibuuliesi biosi mushialo shiosi shiaIsiraeli; mana nakalukha eYerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eshitabu shiamalako shianyoolekha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mumuyika kwekhumi namunaane kwoburuchibwe, olwa yali nasiiyile eshialo nende inzu yene, yaruma Shafani waAzalia, naMaaseya omukafuna welitookho, naYoa waYoahazi, omuhandiichi omulindi wamakhuwa, okhukasia inzu yOMWAMI Nyasayewe aha yali niyibiiyile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo niboola ewaHilikia omukuhani omukhulundu, nibamuheelesia amapeesa akali nikaleerwa munzu yaNyasaye, aka abaLawi abalindi bomuliango bali nibasololanga muManase naEfuraimu, nomumusikalo kwosi kwaIsiraeli naBenyamini, nomubeYerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibakakaama mumakhono kabakholi bemilimo abasinjililanga akeinzu yOMWAMI; nabo abakholi bemilimo abali niba-kholelanga munzu yOMWAMI bakahaana khulwa okhukasia inzu nokhuchikalusia habwene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu baheelesie ababaatsi naboombashi, okhukula amachina amabaatse, nemisaala echiokhuunga nende emikuulo, khulwa tsinzu etsia abaruchi baYuda bali nibalekha nitsionoonekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu tsana nibakhola emilimo nobwisiikwa; nabanyapara babwe bali Yahatsi naObadia, abaLawi abokhubaana baMerari; nabo Zakaria naMeshulamu, abokhubaana babaKohatsi, bali abasinjilili. NabaLawi bandi, bosi abali abasitsa khukebimanulwa biobukhana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibo abali hekulu wabachinji bemisiiko, nibasinjilila bosi abakholanga emilimo, mubukhalabani bwosi bwosi; khandi khubaLawi tsana balikhwo abahandiichi, nabakali, nabalindi bebilibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa bali nibarusinjia amapeesa akaleerwa munzu yOMWAMI, Hilikia omukuhani yanyoola eshitabu shiamalako akahaanwa mumukhono kwaMusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hilikia nasunjila Shafani omuhandiichi ari Enyoolile eshitabu shiamalako munzu yOMWAMI. Hilikia namukaamila Shafani eshitabu tsana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Shafani nayilila omuruchi eshitabu tsana, khandi namukalusilia omuruchi amakhuwa, mbu Kosi aka abasumbabo balachilisibwa, bakakholanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batsushile amapeesa kosi akanyoolwa munzu yOMWAMI, nibakahaana mumakhono kabanyapara, nomumakhono kabakholi bemilimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Shafani omuhandiichi naboolela omuruchi ari Hilikia omukuhani yambeelesiye eshitabu. Shafani nasoomamwo imbeli womuruchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa omuruchi yahulila amakhuwa akali mushitabu shiamalako, yarandula tsingubotsie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi nalaka Hilikia, naAhikamu waShafani, naAbidoni waMika, naShafani omuhandiichi, naAsaya omusumba womuruchi, ari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsie, mureebe ewOMWAMI, khulwanje nokhulwabo abasikaale muIsiraeli nomuYuda, akamakhuwa keshitabu eshinyooleeshe; okhuba oburima bwOMWAMI obukhutsushiilwekhwo nobunji, shichila abakuuka beefwe shibalindanga amakhuwa kOMWAMI, okhukhola kosi akahandiikwa mushitabu shino shinga olwa kali, ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Hilikia, nende abo aba omuruchi yali nalachile, nibatsia ewaHulida omunabii, mukha Shalumu waTokhatsi waHasira, omulindi wetsingubo; ne omukhasi oyo yali niyamenya eYerusalemu, mulukongo lwakhabili; nibamuboolela amakhuwa ako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nabasunjila mbu Kano niko aka OMWAMI, Nyasaye walsiraeli, aboola; mbu Boolele omundu oyo oumurumile, mbu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola; mbu Lola, endi okhuleera amabii habundu hano, nende khubamenyangaho, mbu ebilaka munwa biosi ebiahandiikwa mushitabu eshia basoomile imbel womuruchi waYuda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shichila bandekha, nibasambila abanyasaye bandi amalesi kelibuuliesi, mbu basinyisia nebikhole biamakhono kabwe; niko akachila oburima bwanje nibutsushilwa habundu hano, kata shibulasimibwa ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khumuruchi waYuda, oumurumile okhureeba ewOMWAMI, mumusunjile mbu Kano niko aka OMWAMI, Nyasaye waIsiraeli, aboola; mbu Khumakhuwa ako aka ohuliile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba omwoyokwo kubeele nikutorile, nawe niwituutuyia imbeli w olwa ohuliile amakhuwake khukahabandu hano, nokhukabamenyangaho, niwituutuyia imbeli wanje, norandula tsingubo nolila imbeli wanje; nasi ekhuhuliile; nolwa OMWAMI aboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, ndalakhuyila ewabakuukabo, ne olayilwa khung'aniyo mumulembe; kata tsimonitsio shitsilalola amabii kosi aka ndilileerela habundu hano nokhubamenyangaho ta. Kho nibamukalusilia omuruchi likhuwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
