          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia naviniaho ebisinyo biosi okhurula mubialo biosi ebiali biabaana baIsiraeli, mbu bosi abanyoolwa muIsiraeli banyale okhukhalabanila OMWAMI Nyasaye wabwe. Tsindaalotsie tsiosi shibalekha okhulonda khuMWAMI, Nyasaye wabakuuka babwe, ta.",
          "type": "text",
